sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API as API Server
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    participant DB as Database
    participant PubSub as Redis Pub/Sub

    Client->>API: Update data
    API->>DB: Update in database
    DB->>API: Confirm update
    API->>PubSub: Publish invalidation event
    PubSub->>Cache: Notify all subscribers
    Cache->>Cache: Delete cached item
    API->>Client: Confirm update